1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,500
This is what your clients see when they
open your booking page.

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:16,500
They can explore your services and choose the appointment they want.
Available extras, such as simple nail art, appear in the booking flow.

3
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:25,500
When technician selection is available,
they can choose who they book with.

4
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:39,500
Next, they choose an available date and time,
enter their details, and complete the required booking acknowledgments.

5
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:51,500
They review the information shown and
confirm their appointment.

6
00:00:51,800 --> 00:01:01,500
The confirmation screen shows that the
booking is complete.
